# Bulk user import (SYS-011)

Canonical detail: `README.md` → **Import user hàng loạt**.

## Must preserve

- Admin-only. Bulk create **`role=user` only** (never admin/moderator).
- `.xlsx` only, ≤ 2 MiB. Columns: `ho_ten`, `email`, `ma_phong_ban`, `ma_chuc_vu`, `ma_nhom_quyen`, `mat_khau_tam_thoi`
- **Upload to Convex Storage first**, then server parse/validate/commit from `uploadId`. Never trust client rows for commit.
- Staged file TTL **1 hour** (valid or invalid). Table: `userImportUploads`
- All-or-nothing; preview only when every row valid; duplicate emails (file + DB) block import
- Temp passwords in file (≥8); created users always `mustChangePassword=true`

## Entity codes (department / position / permission group)

- ≤20 chars, `A–Z0–9_-`, store/display uppercase; import match case-insensitive
- Soft-delete; **block delete while users assigned**; recreate same **code** → reactivate
- Permission-group missing codes: backfill via `permissionGroups.ensureCodes`

## Export users (SYS-012)

- Admin-only client `.xlsx` of **active** users; no role/password columns
- Headers with Vietnamese diacritics for admin office use
- Admin/mod: empty group code, group name `Quản trị viên`
- Filename `danh_sach_nguoi_dung_YYYYMMDD_NN.xlsx` via daily `localStorage` counter
- Code: `src/lib/userExport.js`; tests: `tests/user-export.test.mjs`

## Code entry points

- UI: `src/settings/UserBulkImport.jsx`
- Backend: `convex/userImport.ts`, `userImportParse.ts`, `userImportValidate.ts`, `userImportSheet.ts`, `entityCodes.ts`
- Tests: `tests/user-import.test.mjs`, `tests/user-export.test.mjs`
